# Start with Jido V3

The V2 setup cells are retired because their construction and command contracts
changed. Run the complete local example from [the repository README](../README.md)
in IEx after `mix deps.get`. The V3 candidate is local until explicitly published.

For repeatable examples, use the [catalog](../lib/examples/README.md) and
its tests. See [Agent construction](agents.md), [commands](core-loop.md), and
[the migration guide](migration.md).
